note bottom of TimestampMixin
  **Mixins por entidad (modelo final)**
  • Los 4 mixins (con ""SoftDeleteMixin""):
    ""AppointmentStatus"", ""Appointment"".
  • PK·A·T (SIN ""SoftDeleteMixin""):
    ""AppointmentStatusTransition"" (matriz config:
    deshabilitar = ""active=false"" o DELETE),
    ""AppointmentStatusHistory"" y ""AppointmentChangeLog""
    (audit trail inmutable / append-only).
  (Sólo se dibujan las herencias de ""AppointmentStatus""
  y ""Appointment"".)
end note

